### Get feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get single post
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/cmttti6sj00ongzfvi405dtie
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello world"
}

### Delete post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/REPLACE_ME
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/REPLACE_ME/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Nice post!"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/REPLACE_ME
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Like post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/cmttti6sj00ongzfvi405dtie/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unlike post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/cmttti6sj00ongzfvi405dtie/like
